WEBVTT

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:51.920
Soul Contract

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.080
Ninth Contract

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:58.800
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:00.920
Hmph!

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:02.820
That kid at Duanmu's household

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.660
is a Yangming Master for only a few years

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:06.180
How dare he tried to step on us

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.320
Yes, sister

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:10.960
You must help us fight for our rights

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.220
Don't worry

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:13.980
I've been with Li for many years

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.540
I'll settle this issue for sure

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:17.900
That's great

00:02:17.908 --> 00:02:20.453
Thanks so much

00:02:20.453 --> 00:02:21.429
Sure

00:02:21.429 --> 00:02:22.860
For your sake,

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.900
how can we let the Duanmus

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:27.360
simply walk all over us

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:36.070
Hey

00:02:36.071 --> 00:02:36.837
Wake up

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:37.500
Today's...

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.680
Go away

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:40.120
I didn't nap when I was alive

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.580
Can't I get a deep sleep now?

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:42.650
Go away

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:44.660
Lemme have my beauty sleep

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:46.020
I said get up!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.730
What are you trying to do?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.060
Is Linus your name?

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.080
What do you mean?

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.960
Coz Linus likes pulling the blankie

00:02:54.409 --> 00:02:56.204
The ritual ceremony is on today

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.440
Go clean and change quickly

00:02:58.506 --> 00:03:01.161
D-Do I have to go too?

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.850
Welcome, Master Yang

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:07.220
Master Yang

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:10.740
The Master of the house is waiting for you at 2nd level

00:03:10.825 --> 00:03:11.838
Oh

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.260
They make is so grandeur

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.320
I thought I was in a fashion institute

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:19.880
Wow, first time coming here

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.780
Rich folks really know how to spend

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.860
They even have a block for dressing room

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:25.840
It looks like a maze

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:26.750
Excuse me,

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.500
do you know where Duanmu Xi is?

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.280
He's having his hair combed over there

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.000
Why are you staring?

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.270
Come over

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.640
Sure

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.760
Does a ritual need to be so grand?

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:46.930
Sit down

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:53.990
The ritual

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:56.120
is a process to cleanse the world

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.040
It's the most important job for Yangming Masters

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:02.920
Each ritual performance of Yangming Masters

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.160
may be their last

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.400
Therefore,

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.600
you must promise me 3 things

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.680
First, don't break this tassel

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.980
This was weaved using my hair

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:17.120
It's an object that binds our living souls

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:17.980
Second,

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.600
never take off the Soul Binding rings

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.440
I can't even take it off myself,

00:04:22.449 --> 00:04:23.164
alright?

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:24.960
So then,

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.620
what's the third promise?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.670
Do you still remember your name?

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:29.440
Of course

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.540
Yang Jinghua

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:31.740
Why?

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:32.580
Right

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.060
This is the last promise

00:04:36.395 --> 00:04:39.708
You must never forget who you are

00:04:40.005 --> 00:04:41.354
Do you hear?

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:42.440
Here

00:04:42.447 --> 00:04:44.293
Do the pinky swear

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.280
Remember these 3 things clearly

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.720
Why does everything feel so weird today?

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.960
Alright

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.640
I swear to keep

00:04:52.646 --> 00:04:55.270
the promises over a hundred years

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.250
Young Master

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.380
Everything is ready

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:01.500
Time to go

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:02.550
Sure

00:05:03.977 --> 00:05:04.572
Oh yeah

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.680
Everyone will be informed in the ritual that

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:08.680
you,

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.360
Yang Jinghua,

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:14.140
is officially the Soul Image of Duanmu Xi

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.680
So, this is the Soul Image

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:19.570
Gosh

00:05:19.573 --> 00:05:21.040
Such an enormous spectacle

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:24.120
I thought we just kill some chickens and do a bow

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.920
The people who come here

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:29.910
are world famous dignitaries

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:31.100
Mr Taoist

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.780
Between you and Duanmu,

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.280
who is greater?

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.940
Of course, it's him

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:39.020
Two younglings coming together

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.180
Such a delightful scene

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:46.300
The maid right next to them is quite gorgeous too

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:46.840
Hey,

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:49.360
someone's complimenting you, why aren't you happy?

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:50.310
Yang Jinghua,

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:51.780
you took away my limelight

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:54.480
I should be Duanmu Xi's official bride-to-be!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:57.310
I finally get to see Lord Duanmu and his Soul Image

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:59.200
Good thing I bought a personal plane

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.860
- Master Yang, Miss Qin
- It's broadcasted live across the globe

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.920
- Here are the seats prepared for you two
- 13 billion viewers strained to catch a glimpse

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:03.740
Never once

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:05.720
have I gotten the front row seats before

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.120
Obviously,

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:08.460
we are Duanmu's...

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.700
Why the hell am I sitting behind you?!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.280
Who arranged the seating?

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.200
Hello

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.840
I arranged it according to plan

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:17.060
If you have any dissatisfaction, please...

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:21.280
I said I followed the plan accordingly

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:22.140
F*ck

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:23.980
I'm not the one deciding it

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:26.440
Don't assume that you get pampered by Duanmu,

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:29.160
you can anyhow take my position

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.390
Pampered my ass

00:06:30.398 --> 00:06:31.460
I don't even know him

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:32.500
as much as you do

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:32.970
Hmph!

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:34.480
Of course

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:35.448
So,

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:38.340
I should be the one getting upset

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.720
Stop playing nice to please me

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:42.960
Little Yang, Siyao

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.750
You both are quite boisterous

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:48.340
Mind if an old lady like me joins in?

00:06:48.347 --> 00:06:49.895
Certainly,

00:06:49.895 --> 00:06:52.338
we were just talking about you

00:06:52.338 --> 00:06:55.352
being the world's most fashionable senior

00:06:55.352 --> 00:06:57.975
You look so young when you wear this today

00:06:57.975 --> 00:06:58.836
Qin Siyao,

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.900
your face changes drastically like the opera performers

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:02.770
Little Yang

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.640
Are you comfortable staying together with little Xi?

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:08.140
He acts cold on the outside but he's warm-hearted

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:08.820
As for you,

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.720
you need to make some allowances

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:11.240
Alright

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.160
Does he have habit of kicking the blanket every night?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.360
It must be hard for you

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.660
Who arranged the grandma to sit right here?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:18.600
Hello

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.680
I arranged it according to her request

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:25.340
The old lady requested it, why the heck I deserve this?

00:07:25.383 --> 00:07:28.100
I say, when 2 people get together, they become alike

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:30.940
Little Yang now looks very similar to Duanmu

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:33.080
I hope not

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.700
Has it started?

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:38.120
Although, I said I don't wanna

00:07:38.143 --> 00:07:39.049
but

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.021
starting from now on,

00:07:41.021 --> 00:07:43.159
everything that he goes through

00:07:43.159 --> 00:07:45.362
will be inextricably bound with me,

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.470
including

00:07:46.477 --> 00:07:49.006
his past and future

00:07:52.302 --> 00:07:53.129
Stop

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.440
Who are you?

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:55.456
'Tis I

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.460
Butler Situ

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:57.310
I'm sorry

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.660
I've received news that

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.250
you're banished from here

00:08:00.252 --> 00:08:00.940
Therefore,

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.190
I can't let you in

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.005
Do you have to be so cold

00:08:04.005 --> 00:08:05.569
How rude of you

00:08:05.569 --> 00:08:07.711
Then do you know who I am?

00:08:07.711 --> 00:08:08.893
I'm sorry

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:12.320
The name, Na Woni, isn't in the invitation list

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:13.860
Excuse me

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.940
Do you not recognize a VIP?

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.060
She's the Situ household Master

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.080
Be respectful when you speak to her

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.120
Greetings, 2nd Lady

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.920
I'm only doing my part

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:23.660
Alright,

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:24.440
you may leave

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.240
Yes

00:08:25.247 --> 00:08:26.090
Please,

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:27.261
come this way

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:27.980
Hmph!

00:08:27.981 --> 00:08:29.423
Looks like the Duanmus

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.520
still has a reasonable person around

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:33.040
You flatter me

00:08:34.467 --> 00:08:35.254
Hmph!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.500
I don't understand the language

00:08:37.502 --> 00:08:40.813
but through Duanmu Xi's voice, that power

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:43.120
has truly transferred over here

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.760
It's warmth

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:45.960
and forgiveness

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.240
The power that consoles the heart

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:50.460
Duanmu Xi being the source of energy

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.900
that constantly spreads out in all directions

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:55.200
The lives and deaths of all beings

00:08:55.205 --> 00:08:57.236
depend on the balance of world energy

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:59.480
which maintains eternal peace

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.020
The person who can do this

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.600
is Duanmu Xi alone

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.800
By god's name

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.400
and prayer through the heart

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.420
I've said before,

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.360
Duanmu is the man closest to god

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.240
Now you know

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.280
What do you mean "being closest to god"?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.290
This man

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.720
is a god himself, isn't he?

00:09:18.744 --> 00:09:20.868
My heart feels so warm

00:09:20.868 --> 00:09:22.993
It's like I've been purified

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.900
How can I ever win against a guy like him?

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:29.680
The ritual should be over any time soon

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:32.240
I have a request to make

00:09:32.244 --> 00:09:35.024
The person who cannot prove himself worthy

00:09:35.024 --> 00:09:36.540
shouldn't perform the ritual

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:37.904
I'd like to ask

00:09:37.904 --> 00:09:40.416
if he truly can justify himself

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.940
What do you mean?

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.530
Surely you haven't forgotten about our Li,

00:09:45.532 --> 00:09:47.058
have you?

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.690
Thanks to you, our brother

00:09:49.697 --> 00:09:51.923
is expelled and lost his job

00:09:51.923 --> 00:09:53.151
Stop the accusation

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.920
Situ Li stabbed a Yangming Master

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.680
but the Duanmus still spared his life

00:09:56.685 --> 00:09:57.825
What more do you want?

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.080
Who are you?

00:09:59.080 --> 00:09:59.820
Me?

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:03.500
So, you're that ginger haired gal who isn't part of Duanmu's family yet

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.450
What right do you have for you to speak?

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.000
Hey

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.550
Obasan, are you done nagging?

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:08.780
I caused the trouble

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:09.840
and slashed him

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.220
You wanna avenge for the brat,

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:12.100
go right at me!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.300
Are you effing blind?

00:10:13.308 --> 00:10:15.041
Will you look at that, everyone

00:10:15.041 --> 00:10:17.234
This thing gets qualified as Soul Image

00:10:17.234 --> 00:10:20.900
When did the Yangming Master fall so much?

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:21.810
Enough!

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.175
Shut up, all of you!

00:10:23.175 --> 00:10:26.230
Why was I not informed about this?

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:27.151
Great grandma,

00:10:27.151 --> 00:10:29.424
I'm sorry for not informing you

00:10:29.424 --> 00:10:31.573
A few days ago, the Master's Soul Image

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:33.860
had indeed used Luoye Sword to injure Situ

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.970
You don't need to explain it to me

00:10:35.979 --> 00:10:41.052
I want to hear it from the Duanmu Master himself

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:54.560
Yang Jinghua

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:56.080
Come up to the stage

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.030
What's with the plot twist?

00:10:59.033 --> 00:11:00.583
A rich family disputes drama?

00:11:00.583 --> 00:11:01.753
Cool it

00:11:01.753 --> 00:11:02.940
It's a free show

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:04.000
Just watch it along

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.400
It should be good

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:16.520
Kneel down

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.620
Looks like the Master got the picture

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:36.020
He'll publicly extinguish the Soul Image

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:38.720
He's doing it in dignity

00:11:38.757 --> 00:11:40.674
Is this how it's supposed to be?

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:43.780
Duanmu Xi is going to end me right here

00:11:43.805 --> 00:11:45.987
I never expect Young Master Xi

00:11:45.987 --> 00:11:47.285
is that merciless

00:11:47.489 --> 00:11:47.973
Hmph

00:11:47.973 --> 00:11:49.861
The Situs are Spirit Manipulators

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:51.220
with important position

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.380
They've been with Duanmus for generations

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.010
Mr. Yang may be important

00:11:55.018 --> 00:11:58.208
but he can't compare with the relationships of 2 families

00:11:58.208 --> 00:11:59.318
This sword

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:00.620
is called Luoye

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.120
It's a blessed weapon since ancient times

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:05.462
It can take down deities and demons

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:07.760
And subdue evil energy everywhere

00:12:07.769 --> 00:12:11.501
From now on, it's yours

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:15.170
by the decree of Duanmu Xi, the 13th generation of Duanmu Master

00:12:15.175 --> 00:12:17.237
Every tribe and position

00:12:17.237 --> 00:12:19.001
shall not have any objections

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:21.390
Come

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:23.000
Look at me

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:24.377
Focus

00:12:24.611 --> 00:12:26.002
A spirit for today

00:12:26.002 --> 00:12:27.536
An image for life

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.460
In communing spiritual energy

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:30.800
No life and soul separation

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.310
Balance of Yin and Yang

00:12:32.549 --> 00:12:34.957
Peace to all beings

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:55.780
I want you to be my Soul Image

00:13:00.336 --> 00:13:01.383
Mr Taoist

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.260
What's up with Lord Duanmu

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.030
He's simply declaring to the world

00:13:05.034 --> 00:13:07.054
that they are one in heart and mind

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.040
I memorized everything about Soul Images

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.740
Now that's what I call an awesome comeback

00:13:13.337 --> 00:13:14.289
What?

00:13:14.289 --> 00:13:16.653
He proceeds the contract approval ceremony

00:13:16.653 --> 00:13:19.434
and gives away the sacred Luoye Sword

00:13:19.434 --> 00:13:20.277
Duanmu Xi

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.280
You tarnish your name by defending an outsider

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.020
Are you still the Master of the household?

00:13:24.027 --> 00:13:24.681
Ma'am

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:25.800
Say something

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:29.980
I'm so moved

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:33.020
Outsider, you say?

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.770
Now Yang Jinghua is the Master's approved Soul Image

00:13:36.777 --> 00:13:38.352
Everything he does

00:13:38.352 --> 00:13:40.571
is to serve the Master

00:13:40.571 --> 00:13:43.290
The sword he uses is a gift from Duanmu's family

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:46.180
The one you're questioning now isn't just a Soul Image

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.280
but a family member of the Duanmus

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:50.780
That includes me too

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:55.020
Seems like we made a mistake

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.830
Our Situ Li was wrong too

00:13:57.838 --> 00:13:58.541
Come come

